       when World Map Beautification Project is not active: WMBP ships its own BiomesKit, which already provides
       every BiomesKit class/field this mod uses and creates BiomesKitWorldGenStep itself. Loading both gives
       "Adding duplicate WorldGenStepDef name: BiomesKitWorldGenStep" and two copies of the BiomesKit types. -->
  <v1.6>
    <li>/</li>
    <li>1.6</li>
    <li IfModNotActive="zal.wmbp">1.6/BiomesKit</li>
  </v1.6>
  <v1.7>
    <li>/</li>
    <li>1.6</li>
    <li IfModNotActive="zal.wmbp">1.7/BiomesKit</li>
  </v1.7>
</loadFolders>
